# --- Local development (`npm run dev`) ---
# Vite loads `.env`, `.env.local`, and `.env.development` — it does NOT load
# `.env.production`. Put the same VITE_* values in `.env` (or `.env.development`)
# for local dev, e.g. `cp .env.production .env` once (`.env` is gitignored).

# --- Netlify (or any host): VITE_* is baked in at `npm run build` ---
# After changing variables in Netlify, trigger a new deploy (e.g. “Clear cache and deploy”).
# The live site will not update until a build runs with those values.

# Set VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY in the host’s env UI, then redeploy
# (“Clear cache and deploy”). Skipping this leaves FormSubmit, which often
# shows “success” before mail is reliable (activation / spam).

# --- Contact form (recommended: Web3Forms) ---
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=

# Optional: override FormSubmit / custom POST URL
# VITE_CONTACT_FORM_ACTION=

# --- Visit section ---
# Use | between lines when a single .env line is easier (or use real newlines if your editor supports multi-line env values).
VITE_ADDRESS_LINES=radha nagar, Near dav field | Bulandshahr, Uttar Pradesh, India
VITE_HOURS_LINES=Mon–Sat: 7:00 AM – 9:00 PM | Sun: Closed
VITE_FEE_NOTE=Ask at the desk for current daily / monthly seating rates.

# tel: link (include country code). If omitted, VITE_WHATSAPP is used for Call + WhatsApp.
VITE_PHONE=+918630849602
VITE_PHONE_DISPLAY=+918630849602

# WhatsApp: digits only with country code → floating button + Visit card link.
# If omitted, the app uses VITE_PHONE digits for wa.me when possible.
VITE_WHATSAPP=+918630849602

# Map: VITE_MAP_QUERY is used for the “Open in Google Maps” link.
# For an inline map iframe, paste the full embed URL from Google Maps → Share → Embed a map:
# VITE_MAP_EMBED_URL=https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=...

# --- Optional site extras ---
# Banner under the header (dismissible for the session). Use | between lines.
# VITE_ANNOUNCEMENT=AC maintenance Tue 2–4 PM — other hours normal.|Carry your own water bottle.

# Footer social / map links: Label~URL pairs separated by | (tilde between label and URL)
# VITE_SOCIAL_LINKS=Instagram~https://www.instagram.com/yourpage|Google Maps~https://maps.google.com/...
